msgstr ""
"Vyberte operáciu, ktorá sa má vykonať na alpha channel (pozrite nižšie)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:75
msgid "Invert"
msgstr "Invertovať"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:77
msgid ""
"Inverts the input alpha channel, transparent will become opaque and vice "
"versa."
msgstr ""
"Invertuje vstupný alpha channel; priehľadné sa stane nepriehľadným a naopak."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:78
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:130
msgid "Threshold"
msgstr "Prah"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:79
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:82
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Celé číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:80
msgid "This is only used for the Threshold operation"
msgstr "Toto sa používa iba pre operáciu Prahovanie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:81
msgid "Shrink/Grow/Blur"
msgstr "Zmenšenie/Zväčšenie/Rozmazanie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:83
msgid ""
"Depending on the chosen operation: How far the shrinking/growing will "
"extend, or the amount of blur"
msgstr ""
"V závislosti od zvolenej operácie: Do akej miery sa bude zmenšovanie/"
"zväčšovanie rozširovať, alebo množstvo rozmazania"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:85
msgid "The following selection items are available:"
msgstr "K dispozícii sú nasledujúce položky výberu:"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:87
msgid ":guilabel:`Display`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Zobrazenie`"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:89
msgid ""
"This is intended for monitoring during adjustment mostly. After adjusting "
"the parameters, it should be left on **Image**, which lets the unchanged "
"input image through - this effect is intended to change only the alpha "
"channel."
msgstr ""
"Je to určené hlavne na monitorovanie počas úprav. Po nastavení parametrov by "
"malo byť ponechané na **Obrázok**, čo prepustí nezmenený vstupný obraz – "
"tento efekt je určený na zmenu iba alpha channel."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:96
msgid "Image"
msgstr "Obrázok"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:97
msgid "Image after the operation  (default)"
msgstr "Obrázok po operácii (predvolené)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:98
msgid "Alpha as gray"
msgstr "Alpha ako sivá"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:99
msgid "Displays the alpha channel as gray"
msgstr "Zobrazuje alpha channel ako odtiene sivej"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:100
msgid "Gray + red"
msgstr "Sivá + červená"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:101
msgid "Displays the alpha channel as gray, everything else as red"
msgstr "Zobrazuje alpha channel ako odtiene sivej, všetko ostatné ako červenú"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:102
msgid "Selection on black"
msgstr "Výber na čiernom"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:103
msgid "Displays the non-alpha channels on a black background"
msgstr "Zobrazuje kanály bez alpha na čiernom pozadí"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:104
msgid "Selection on gray"
msgstr "Výber na sivom"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:105
msgid "Displays the non-alpha channels on a gray background"
msgstr "Zobrazuje kanály bez alpha na sivom pozadí"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:106
msgid "Selection on white"
msgstr "Výber na bielom"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:107
msgid "Displays the non-alpha channels on a white background"
msgstr "Zobrazuje kanály bez alpha na bielom pozadí"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:108
msgid "Selection on checkers"
msgstr "Výber na šachovnici"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:109
msgid "Displays the non-alpha channels on a checkered background"
msgstr "Zobrazuje kanály bez alpha na šachovnicovom pozadí"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:112
msgid ":guilabel:`Operation`"
msgstr "Operácia"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:118
msgid "NO OP"
msgstr "NO OP"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:119
msgid "No operation is performed"
msgstr "Nevykoná sa žiadna operácia"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:120
msgid "Shave"
msgstr "Oholenie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:121
msgid ""
"Tries to remove the \"hairy\" stuff, and also shrinks the selection a bit"
msgstr "Pokúša sa odstrániť „chlpaté\" časti a taktiež mierne zmenší výber"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:122
msgid "Shrink hard"
msgstr "Tvrdé zmenšenie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:123
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:125
msgid "Shrinks the area of the alpha channel"
msgstr "Zmenšuje plochu alpha kanála"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:124
msgid "Shrink soft"
msgstr "Mäkké zmenšenie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:126
msgid "Grow hard"
msgstr "Tvrdé zväčšenie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:127
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:129
msgid "Grows the area of the alpha channel"
msgstr "Zväčšuje plochu alpha kanála"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:128
msgid "Grow soft"
msgstr "Mäkké zväčšenie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:131
msgid "Increases or decreases the area of the alpha channel by the threshold"
msgstr "Zväčšuje alebo zmenšuje plochu alpha kanála o hodnotu prahu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:132
msgid "Blur"
msgstr "Rozmazať"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:133
msgid "Blurs the area between the alpha and the other channels"
msgstr "Rozmazáva oblasť medzi alpha a ostatnými kanálmi"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:135
msgid ""
"The **... hard** operations introduce no new values to the alpha channel, so "
"if you have a **hard** key (only 0 and 255) it will stay that way."
msgstr ""
"Operácie **... tvrdé** nezavadzajú do alpha kanála žiadne nové hodnoty, "
"takže ak máte **tvrdý** kľúč (iba 0 a 255), zostane tak."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:137
msgid ""
"The **... soft** operations will introduce interpolated values, making the "
"edge softer."
msgstr ""
"Operácie **... mäkké** zavedú interpolované hodnoty, čím sa hrana zjemní."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:139
msgid ""
"The shave, shrink and grow operations are quite slow, because they do many "
"conditional operations on each pixel."
msgstr ""
"Operácie oholenie, zmenšenie a zväčšenie sú pomerne pomalé, pretože "
"vykonávajú mnoho podmienených operácií na každom pixeli."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:145
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Poznámky"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:150
msgid ""
"This |tutorial_1| shows usage of Alpha Operations with Shrink Hard as well "
"as the following effects: :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"alpha_mask_keying/chroma_key`, :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"grain_and_noise/denoise_hqdn3d`, and :doc:`/effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/key_spill_mop_up`."
msgstr ""
"Tento |tutorial_1| ukazuje použitie Alpha operácií s Tvrdým zmenšením, ako "
"aj nasledujúce efekty: :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"alpha_mask_keying/chroma_key`, :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"grain_and_noise/denoise_hqdn3d` a :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"alpha_mask_keying/key_spill_mop_up`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:152
msgid ""
"**This video is somewhat outdated.** In newer versions of Kdenlive the :doc:"
"`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/key_spill_mop_up` "
"effect is installed by default, and it is no longer required to use a "
"composite transition. Nevertheless, the basic steps of chroma keying and key "
"spill mop up are explained and are still valid."
msgstr ""
"**Toto video je trochu zastarané.** V novších verziách Kdenlive je efekt :"
"doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/key_spill_mop_up` "
"nainštalovaný predvolene a používanie kompozitného prechodu už nie je "
"potrebné. Napriek tomu sú základné kroky chroma keying a key spill mop up "
"vysvetlené a stále platia."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/alpha_operations.rst:157
msgid ""
"The description of this effect has been taken in parts from the readme file "
"for the frei0r |alphaops| plugin. You find much more detailed information "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Popis tohto efektu bol čiastočne prevzatý zo súboru readme zásuvného modulu "
"frei0r |alphaops|. Oveľa podrobnejšie informácie nájdete tam."

